cer","format":"video","caption":"A little taste of Paris, right here in Dubai. 🇫🇷🥖\n\nIf you’re looking to try authentic French deli flavours, fresh gourmet sandwiches, and premium ingredients, this spot is definitely worth adding to your foodie list. Whether you dine in or order from your favourite delivery app, it’s a must-try for every food lover.\n\nMy Birthday Series of finding amazing restaurants #lavrecommends💯💯 \n\n📍Chlew Delishop Dubai \n\n#MyDubai #DubaiFoodie #DubaiRestaurants DubaiEats\n\n(Dubai-it, Dubai influencer, Dubai food blogger, French deli Dubai, gourmet sandwiches Dubai, best sandwiches Dubai, hidden gems Dubai, foodie Dubai, restaurant collaboration, food collaboration UAE, Dubai lifestyle, UAE food guide)","captionLanguage":"en","thumbnailMediaId":"med_76d5c2a31e4db15e79af979084eb","publishedAt":"2026-07-13T12:58:04.000Z","profileId":"prf_264d28bc5a6fecafe8a8264482eb","thumbnailMediaUrl":"https://oriane-contents.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/Dau9kNcKeoc/thumbnail.webp","viewsCount":1439039,"likesCount":17394,"sharesCount":471,"commentsCount":44,"interactionsCount":17909,"engagementRatePerViews":1.2445110938619453,"engagementRatePerFollowers":1.6128581965419326,"profileFollowersCount":1110389,"profileFollowingCount":1455,"profilePostsCount":1971,"mediaCount":1,"duration":44,"hashtags":["#dubaifoodie","#lavrecommends","#mydubai","#dubairestaurants"],"coAuthors":[{"id":null,"platformId":null,"profileHandle":"chlew.dxb"}],"mentions":[],"platformId":"Dau9kNcKeoc","profilePlatformId":"631497769","profilePictureUrl":"https://oriane-handles.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/lavanyavikram_/pfp.webp","profileBio":"Founder @blushncurls.dubai \n🎥Licensed Content Creator \nStyle Icon2024  \n👉🏼Awards-Filmfare InfluentialWomen2025 Global50Women \nPress @khaleejtimes More","profileVerified":true,"locationPlatformId":"301880981542","locationCompleteAddress":"Beach Park Plaza Centre- Jumeirah, Beach Road, Jumeirah 1 (Opp.Jumeirah Beach Park)","locationLatitude":25.19844,"locationLongitude":55.23824,"profileLocationPlatformId":null,"profileLocationCompleteAddress":null,"profileLocationLatitude":null,"profileLocationLongitude":null,"transcript":"What if I told you that Paris' favorite deli shop has just arrived in Dubai and it is something that you haven't seen or heard before. So I'm going to take you through and show you which place is this. Meet Shlou Deli Shop bringing an authentic taste of France right here to Dubai. From freshly made gourmet sandwiches layered with premium shakot tori to beautifully curated deli selections, every bite is packed with authentic French flavors. Everything is prepared fresh using high quality ingredients and you can genuinely taste the difference. If you are a foodie who loves discovering unique spots, this is one place you need to add to your list. And the best part, you can also order it straight to your doorstep through Deliveroo Talabat, Noon Food and other major delivery platforms. Bon Appetit!","transcriptLanguage":"en","transcriptChunks":[{"startSeconds":0.132,"endSeconds":5.812,"text":"What if I told you that Paris' favorite deli shop has just arrived in Dubai and it is something"},{"startSeconds":5.812,"endSeconds":7.892,"text":"that you haven't seen or heard before."},{"startSeconds":7.892,"endSeconds":11.092,"text":"So I'm going to take you through and show you which place is this."},{"startSeconds":11.092,"endSeconds":15.792,"text":"Meet Shlou Deli Shop bringing an authentic taste of France right here to Dubai."},{"startSeconds":15.792,"endSeconds":21.092,"text":"From freshly made gourmet sandwiches layered with premium shakot tori to beautifully curated"},{"startSeconds":21.092,"endSeconds":25.192,"text":"deli selections, every bite is packed with authentic French flavors."},{"startSeconds":25.192,"endSeconds":29.492,"text":"Everything is prepared fresh using high quality ingredients and you can genuinely taste the"},{"startSeconds":29.492,"endSeconds":30.492,"text":"difference."},{"startSeconds":30.492,"endSeconds":35.252,"text":"If you are a foodie who loves discovering unique spots, this is one place you need to add to"},{"startSeconds":35.252,"endSeconds":36.252,"text":"your list."},{"startSeconds":36.252,"endSeconds":39.812,"text":"And the best part, you can also order it straight to your doorstep through Deliveroo Talabat,"},{"startSeconds":39.812,"endSeconds":42.612,"text":"Noon Food and other major delivery platforms."},{"startSeconds":42.612,"endSeconds":43.372,"text":"Bon Appetit!"}],"frames":[{"id":"med_3d160108d09ac461f8b3bb519ecc","position":1,"timestampSeconds":10.5,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/Dau9kNcKeoc/1_10.50.webp"},{"id":"med_2711f19a62018bfbcb37c5a1bd85","position":2,"timestampSeconds":10.77,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/Dau9kNcKeoc/2_10.77.webp"},{"id":"med_365529c6b5bc5b77c62ff8b12087","position":3,"timestampSeconds":10.8,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/Dau9kNcKeoc/3_10.80.webp"},{"id":"med_8bed1d8aa9208b2c55ce0f670822","position":4,"timestampSeconds":12.57,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/Dau9kNcKeoc/4_12.57.webp"},{"id":"med_b29fc5096f202388c92f11766bab","position":5,"timestampSeconds":13.6,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/Dau9kNcKeoc/5_13.60.webp"},{"id":"med_53868ef6040596bf7721e57f1576","position":6,"timestampSeconds":16.37,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/Dau9kNcKeoc/6_16.37.webp"},{"id":"med_e2b942f032eae5ca925c9be7fd98","position":7,"timestampSeconds":17.4,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/Dau9kNcKeoc/7_17.40.webp"},{"id":"med_f30f8a7123e59a847d9baecfb0ad","position":8,"timestampSeconds":20.4,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/Dau9kNcKeoc/8_20.40.webp"},{"id":"med_e0514d300ff4d67ef89806d7d672","position":9,"timestampSeconds":20.43,